    p "Section, " ["Pub. L. 91–663, § 10" -> "/us/pl/91/663/s10"] ", Jan. 8, 1971, " ["84 Stat. 1978" -> "/us/stat/84/1978"] "; " ["Pub. L. 96–470, title I, § 112(h)" -> "/us/pl/96/470/tI/s112/h"] ", Oct. 19, 1980, " ["94 Stat. 2240" -> "/us/stat/94/2240"] ", directed the Secretary to make a report to the President and Congress on financial condition of each railroad except Central Railroad Company of New Jersey and Penn Central Transportation Company, having a loan guaranteed under this chapter ninety days after the making of such guarantee and annually thereafter throughout existence of such loan."
